      ],
      "reason": "These are dated, accurate statements that the tier could not complete on this machine, together with the sub-steps each lane ran individually. They are evidence, not stale instructions, and CP-106 explicitly accepted exactly that reporting style. Rewriting them would make the repository's history claim a working gate where none ran. ACCEPTED AND LEFT BYTE-IDENTICAL. A reader of any one of these finds this file and CP-108 from the record's own CP-106 citation."
    },
    "cite_CP_106": {
