        "WFC-003"
      ]
    }
  },
  "edits_not_made": {
    "what": "No per-record edits to the 27 task records.",
    "why": "1. The command each record names is now achievable, so the records are not wrong. 2. The records that are factually dated statements of fact are evidence, and editing evidence is worse than leaving it. 3. docs/engineering/tasks/TASK_INDEX.json is currently modified by a concurrent lane regenerating maps; rewriting 27 records would either collide with that or force a mid-flight refresh, which the task brief forbids. The disposition is recorded here, in CP-108, and in the release STATE file instead.",
    "if_you_want_per_record_annotation": "Orchestrator decision. A single additive `verification.tier_result_reason` string on each of the 20 never-run records, naming CP-108 and the scoped bound, would be safe to apply once no lane is regenerating TASK_INDEX.json. This lane did not do it."
  },
  "still_unachievable_on_this_machine_and_not_affected_by_this_fix": {
